does not usually fit your people.\n\nInspired by the stories of dragons, gold, and the treasures to be found in ancient ruins, you have decided to venture into the old and wild places of the world, looking for fame and glory.\n\nYou have come to a land called the Derthfields on the western border of the Thaloren forest, in search of the Trollmire. It is an old forest infested with trolls and all kinds of wild animals.\nTo the west lies another dangerous place: the old ruins of Kor'Pul. You heard the caves below it were infested by vermin and undead.\n\nAfter days of travel, you have found the forest and entered it. What will you find there...?\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"欢迎你 #LIGHT_GREEN#@name@#WHITE#！\n你是来自德斯小镇的一个半身人。大多数人认为半身人是热爱和平的农民，从来不会离开他们的农庄。\n但历史证明，半身人也是不好对付的，他们仍然保留有强大的军队。\n你选择了一条异于常人的道路：成为一名冒险者，半身人很少选择这种寂寞的生活。\n\n你被那些关于龙、黄金以及古老废墟中宝藏的传说所吸引，你决定前往那些古老而荒野的地方，寻找名声和荣耀。\n\n你来到了自然精灵森林西部边境一个叫做德斯荒野的地方，寻找巨魔沼泽。这是一个被巨魔和野生动物占据的古老树林。向西走还有另一个危险的区域：卡·普尔废墟。你听说那里的地下盘踞着大量的害虫和亡灵生物。\n\n经过了几天的旅行，你终于发现并进入了这个树林，你会在那里发现什么呢……\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"26a5299fe63d7868ebdf1815f2c550fac3ad51c248d13d8188ebff984af6bb99","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"38901bd7b8459bc8ace75ab3ca97cac7563571efba2cd6de62f098a913bbeccb","logical_entry_identity":"2aacb6685906489090c569c56aa7be7a356a08f970fbd5ee588e3b1faf335819","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"sets off a powerful explosion","source_tag":"_t","target":"产生一次猛烈的爆炸"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"95a62886f0829a1afba4b70bb1073e20de851a8b5552ce1ce1fe62a4ce570631","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"389202fd8c936d6c9177039bcb0c33359963af95e19adf5b356cea3acd9c8c5d","logical_entry_identity":"bcabc94554c00b8d1c04904665a7d063398a7fc2df720fb5075107fae9723c25","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"dream","source_tag":"_t","target":"梦境"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2110b5f64e95c0251f7898412b76a1ecebbd4448c69304334f5c565157ae6379","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3892de16b7f3490f